; EditTry -- WaveSmith by hand on the real machine, listening through
; the card (prisma.library in LIBS:, nothing is installed). A copy of the
; test single (Test/Edit/Single.wav, tools/make_edit_single.py) is
; trimmed in RAM:WaveSmith; what to try is in EditTry.txt, shown first. The
; saved file is copied to Edit/Trim.wav beside this script afterwards.
FailAt 21
Assign >NIL: DEV: ""
More DEV:EditTry.txt
Delete >NIL: RAM:WaveSmith ALL QUIET
MakeDir >NIL: RAM:WaveSmith
Copy >NIL: DEV:sasc/WaveSmith RAM:WaveSmith/
Copy >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Single.wav RAM:WaveSmith/Trim.wav
Copy >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Single.prl RAM:WaveSmith/Trim.prl
Version RAM:WaveSmith/WaveSmith FULL
Echo "=== WaveSmith: the window is the test; close it when done"
RAM:WaveSmith/WaveSmith RAM:WaveSmith/Trim.wav
Echo "WaveSmith has ended (RC $RC)"
MakeDir >NIL: DEV:Edit
Copy >NIL: RAM:WaveSmith/Trim.wav DEV:Edit/Trim.wav
Copy >NIL: RAM:WaveSmith/Trim.prl DEV:Edit/Trim.prl
Copy >NIL: DEV:Test/Edit/Single.prl DEV:Edit/Single.prl
List DEV:Edit/Trim.wav NOHEAD LFORMAT "=== saved: %n %l bytes"
Echo "=== done"
